              "blocks": {
                "text_U7yYp8": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Current fashion jewelry trends emphasize bold gold textures, colorful gemstone accents, and sustainable lab-grown diamonds. Layered necklaces and asymmetrical earring designs are also high-demand items in our latest fine jewelry updates.</p>",
